Rom 11:1 , God has not cast off all Israel;
Rom 11:7 , Some were elected, though the rest were hardened;
Rom 11:16 , There is hope of their conversion;
Rom 11:18 , The Gentiles may not exult over them;
Rom 11:26 , for there is a promise of their salvation;
Rom 11:33 , God's judgments are unsearchable.
